{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佐賀県出身   19歳   佐藤愛桜です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thシングル初のオンラインミート＆グリートありがとうございました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生LIVEの感想、沢山伝えて下さりとても嬉しかったです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんとお話ししていると、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからのLIVEをもっといい物にしていきたい！とか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前回の自分を超えていきたい‼︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もっともっと感動していただけるようになりたい！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と改めて強く思いました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesの皆さんに出会える事が、私の生きる力になっています！\n本当にいつも支えて頂きありがとうございます🥹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、私が気づかない所まで色々気付いて下さり、思っている以上に細かい所まで見てくださっていて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんが感想を伝えてく下さる度に、すごく幸せな気持ちになります☺️\nいつも本当にありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真沢山撮ったので載せますね📷⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moboSGYmY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobrX94oH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobWD5RKk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このお洋服お気に入りです~🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなお洋服好きだよ〜とか着て欲しいな〜とかあったら是非教えて下さいね♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobwylOp2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobTkRC2D.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全身はこんな感じでした~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobjBto1w.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobQfsFgl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し前にカメラを購入しました📷\nこれからはメンバーだったり風景だったり色々と撮っていきたいな~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobA2tgI3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobMGcLHd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後に自撮りも🎀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "21日のオンラインミート＆グリート楽しみにしています~！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで見て下さりありがとうございました🍀* ゚"}], "source": "official"}